<title>USA: ID Biomedical knows no reason share price decline.</title>
<headline>ID Biomedical knows no reason share price decline.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>ID Biomedical Corp said Tuesday it is not aware of any change to its business fundamentals that would account for the recent decline in its share price.</p>
<p>The company's stock closed at 4-3/4 on October 7. The 52-week high for the stock is nine.</p>
<p>ID Biomedical develops medical products and technologies related to human infectious diseases.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
